# Fortran scratch units. gfortran implicitly connects an undefined unit number
# and creates fort.<n> in the CWD; the ereport shim makes that reachable by
# letting glomap_box_config_mod continue past a failed OPEN(NEWUNIT=). Ignored
# so they cannot be committed again -- 14 of them were, in 4c84059.
fort.[0-9]*
fortran/TOOLCHAIN.txt
.refstage/

